  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73ff519377b990a4c81cd1461a3c1f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: Pedro_Quest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Pedro
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: Awan ti problema. Kabusor a rag-o ti nasarakan ko anyway. Masapul
    mo kadi? Mabalin mo nga alaen. Ngem masapul nga agay-ayam ka kadakami iti sumaruno
    a panawen!
  translatedText: It's okay. It's a random toy I found anyway. Do you need it? You
    can take it. But you have to play with us next time!
